/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 69 0 R
/T (The problem addressed by this project is to build a secure, consistent and well-structured backend that supports the complete product-to-order workflow for three kinds of users \(customers, sellers and administrators\), keeps stock quantities accurate under concurrent purchases, validates every order on the server, and provides reporting and real-time notifications. )
/E (The problem addressed by this project is to build a secure, consistent and well-structured backend that supports the complete product-to-order workflow for three kinds of users \(customers, sellers and administrators\), keeps stock quantities accurate under concurrent purchases, validates every order on the server, and provides reporting and real-time notifications. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
