/T (A shared EventEmitter instance acts as an internal event bus. Controllers emit three domain events: order.placed, order.statusChanged and stock.low. A separate listener module subscribes to these events and sends Socket.IO messages. This decouples business logic from notification delivery: new listeners \(e-mail, audit log\) can be added without changing any controller. Socket.IO connections are authenticated with the JWT access token in the handshake. Every user joins a privateroom user:<id>, and admins also join role:admin. )
/E (A shared EventEmitter instance acts as an internal event bus. Controllers emit three domain events: order.placed, order.statusChanged and stock.low. A separate listener module subscribes to these events and sends Socket.IO messages. This decouples business logic from notification delivery: new listeners \(e-mail, audit log\) can be added without changing any controller. Socket.IO connections are authenticated with the JWT access token in the handshake. Every user joins a privateroom user:<id>, and admins also join role:admin. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
