1030 0 obj
<<
/Title (The project delivers a complete, secure and well-structured e-commerce backend. It demonstrates Node.js and Express fundamentals, MVC-style separation of concerns, Mongoose data modelling with indexes and aggregation, JWT-based authentication with role-based authorization, centralized validation and error handling, and real-time communication through EventEmitter and Socket.IO. The atomic stock update strategy guarantees inventory accuracy under concurrent purchases, and server-side pricing and status rules keep orders trustworthy. The Postman collection provides repeatable evidence that both the normal and the failure paths behave correctly.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 996 0 R
/Next 1031 0 R
>>
endobj
