1059 0 obj
<<
/Title (The stock check and the decrement happen in oneatomic MongoDB operation. If two customers try to buy the last unit simultaneously, only one updatematches the filter and the other receives a 409 conflict. If any item in a checkout fails, the stockalready reserved for earlier items is restored \(compensating rollback\). The price used for the ordercomes from the document returned by this update, so it is the price at the exact moment of purchase.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1026 0 R
/Prev 1058 0 R
>>
