1103 0 obj
<<
/Title (A shared EventEmitter instance acts as an internal event bus. Controllers emit three domain events: order.placed, order.statusChanged and stock.low. A separate listener module subscribes to these events and sends Socket.IO messages. This decouples business logic from notification delivery: new listeners \(e-mail, audit log\) can be added without changing any controller. Socket.IO connections are authenticated with the JWT access token in the handshake. Every user joins a privateroom user:<id>, and admins also join role:admin.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1064 0 R
/First 1143 0 R
/Last 1144 0 R
/Count -5
>>
endobj
